# Additional vectors derived by hand from SPEC.md v1.0 (one block per rule).
### a2-a3-strict-limits-and-deadband
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=0
init 0
s 1 30
s 2 10
s 3 30.5
s 4 28
s 5 27.999
s 6 9.5
s 7 12
s 8 12.5
---
cfg
NORMAL
NORMAL
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@3:30.500
HIGH
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@5:27.999
LOW TO_LOW@6:9.500
LOW
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@8:12.500
